{'symbol': 'IFF', 'date': '2022-03-22 09:00:00', 'title': 'IFF TO SHOWCASE RENEWABLE INDUSTRIAL SOLUTIONS AND POLYMER PORTFOLIO AT AMERICAN COATINGS SHOW', 'text': "WILMINGTON, DEL., MARCH 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IFF'S INDUSTRIAL SOLUTIONS WILL BRING ITS DEEP TECHNICAL EXPERTISE, COMMITMENT TO QUALITY AND BROAD PORTFOLIO OF RENEWABLE POLYMERS TO THE AMERICAN COATINGS SHOW (ACS) FOR THE FIRST TIME ON APRIL 5-7."}